<ecoSpold xmlns="http://www.EcoInvent.org/EcoSpold02">
  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7b3c1d71-6a22-502a-8bf3-2acad39d509f" activityNameId="ade70386-70f6-591b-8832-324e4070a4a2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Production efforts, resistors</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Production efforts, resistors
Data are a rough estimation of the average production efforts over all types of resistors, incl. potentiometers. Data for auxillaries, energy, emissions and waste are taken from four datasets ouf of an international LCI database. Infrastructure and transportation efforts are based on own assumptions. Updates were made in 2023, showing that 20% energy reduction is achieved; UUID: 8740386b-26bc-346a-a1ec-d8177539fa3c
This module includes auxillary and energy consumption, emissions (air, water) and waste amounts, as well as an estimation of the efforts for transportation and of the infrastructure for the production of resistors.
Location: Data from literature – here representing the global situation.
Technology: Average technology for the production of resistors and potentiometers - comprising terminmation printing; resistive body printing; glass coat printing; laser trimming; substrate stripping (SMT) resp. ceramic rods; deposition processes; ageing; capping (THT) resp. printing; curing; punching; revetting; molding (ptoentiom.)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: estimation - based on literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8740386b-26bc-346a-a1ec-d8177539fa3c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">GLO</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: Data from literature – here representing the global situation.</text>
        </comment>
      </geography>
      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: Average technology for the production of resistors and potentiometers - comprising terminmation printing; resistive body printing; glass coat printing; laser trimming; substrate stripping (SMT) resp. ceramic rods; deposition processes; ageing; capping (THT) resp. printing; curing; punching; revetting; molding (ptoentiom.)</text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
      <timePeriod startDate="2023-01-01" endDate="2029-12-31" isDataValidForEntirePeriod="false">
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Time period: Unspecified</text>
        </comment>
